# Private host file: /home/sat/.config/hex/thermal-primal.env (0600).
# This template contains no credentials and must not be sourced as a command.
# Supply only the separately qualified Hex sender path, byte pin and version.
# Do not replace/restart the operator bunker binary to prepare this sender.
EARTHSHIP_PRIMAL_NAK=/absolute/path/to/separately-qualified-nak
EARTHSHIP_PRIMAL_NAK_SHA256=REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_64_HEX_SHA256
EARTHSHIP_PRIMAL_NAK_VERSION="REPLACE_WITH_EXACT_VERSION_OUTPUT"
# Provision NOSTR_SECRET_KEY privately for the Hex collector identity.
# If using NIP-46, provision its authorized NOSTR_CLIENT_KEY privately as well.
# Provision the existing restricted THERMAL_DATABASE_URL,
# THERMAL_DATABASE_RUNTIME_ROLE and THERMAL_DATABASE_EXPECTED_OWNER privately.
# This command never needs the operator recipient's private signing key.
